{"query_id": "dp-section-after-clause", "tags": ["opening-or-section"], "dimensions": ["opening-or-section"], "answer": "The paragraph right after clause 24.111 in the Brackleton Facilities framework agreement (Document ID: 025cf41b-9ad2-4c2a-82e7-3512aeaea87f) states: \"Intellectual property created specifically for the customer vests in the customer on payment. The supplier shall comply with the customer's site rules while present at a customer location. Any variation is effective only when signed by an authorised representative of each party.\" [1]\n\nNote: This paragraph appears under Section 24 (Site addenda) of the Brackleton Facilities framework agreement, not the Tessivar Cloud framework agreement. The Tessivar Cloud framework agreement does not contain a clause numbered 24.111 in its Section 24 (Evidence and records); its Section 24 contains clauses 24.108–24.111 [2]. If you are asking about the paragraph following clause 24.111 in the Tessivar Cloud agreement's Section 24, that section ends at clause 24.111, and the next section (Section 33) begins with clause 33.153 [4].", "answer_sha256": "1b77867148c64839ed5838dddf8ae0ef756a931d0a7f3dd9527ef43cc58d449b", "ranked_ids": ["agreement-long-2", "agreement-long-0", "contract-01"], "citation_map": {"1": "agreement-long-2", "10": "agreement-long-0", "11": "agreement-long-0", "12": "agreement-long-0", "13": "agreement-long-0", "14": "agreement-long-0", "15": "agreement-long-0", "16": "agreement-long-0", "17": "agreement-long-0", "18": "agreement-long-0", "19": "agreement-long-0", "2": "agreement-long-0", "20": "agreement-long-0", "21": "agreement-long-0", "22": "agreement-long-0", "23": "agreement-long-0", "24": "contract-01", "25": "contract-01", "3": "agreement-long-0", "4": "agreement-long-0", "5": "agreement-long-0", "6": "agreement-long-0", "7": "agreement-long-0", "8": "agreement-long-0", "9": "agreement-long-0"}, "cited_ids": [1, 2, 4], "cited_document_ids": ["agreement-long-2", "agreement-long-0"], "inval